# P8: the synth patch editor on the Mini. Instr held + Up x3 picks Synth 1 (no pads on the Mini), Menu box 1 (Instrument Parameters), F8 opens the patch editor in its section grid, Mid enters the
# section (the value focus, setSection), Down x3 picks the fourth parameter (Shape 1, a number value), the Mini's + key x3 turns it up and - once
# down (Plus1 / Minus1 are the encoder of the Mini, interfaceInputs.cpp functMiniPlus1). F5 / F7 step the parameter, not the value.
# plus_flows.sh reads the editor afterwards (UISHOT_TRACE_SYNTHVAL): the value must rise then fall at that parameter.
# Replay: plus_flows.sh mini
title: Synth patch value on the Mini (P8)
check: texts
pause: 90ms

wait 1500ms
press Instr
wait 400ms
tap Up x3
wait 300ms
release Instr
wait 600ms
press Menu
wait 400ms
tap Right
wait 300ms
release Menu
wait 1200ms
tap F8
wait 1500ms
expect text "Edit Patch"
expect text "Synth 1"
tap Mid
wait 400ms
tap Down x3
wait 600ms
tap Plus1 x3
wait 600ms
tap Minus1
wait 600ms
shot patch-value
